    "testimonials": {
      "type": "rb-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“There is a great need for a nurturing place where artists at all levels can learn new approaches and styles in different media. The Studio is a place where you can grow.”</p>",
            "attribution": "- Michelle Alexander",
            "background": "#e07468",
            "quote_color": "#0c3642",
            "attr_color": "#0c3642"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“Friday is now my favorite day of the week. Zara is a nurturing, gentle and inspiring teacher and I am learning so much and in a fun and lighthearted atmosphere. It’s a wonderful group of supportive and encouraging people. Everyone brings something different and meaningful to add to my creative process. I highly recommend it.”</p>",
            "attribution": "- Dani Rubehiemer",
            "background": "#b00e3f",
            "quote_color": "#e07468",
            "attr_color": "#e07468"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“The SA Art Fair is such a special organisation that is run by the amazing duo; Georgina &amp; Bianca. The way that these 2 ladies support South African artists &amp; South African art in general, is just wonderful! The Studio is such a special spot too!!”</p>",
            "attribution": "- Kate Mackenzie",
            "background": "#0c3642",
            "quote_color": "#e07468",
            "attr_color": "#e07468"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“I have been attending the watercolor classes at the SA Art Fair Studio this term and am absolutely loving them. I have been so impressed by what we have all been able to create in a few sessions. The class has students from all skill levels and if you are just there for the fun of it (like I am!), you never feel left behind or overwhelmed. It’s been nice to meet new faces and learn new watercolor techniques from an artist in a fun, welcoming environment. I can highly recommend this space for experienced artists and newbies who are looking for some creative ‘me time’.”</p>",
            "attribution": "- Tarryn Bartlett",
            "background": "#e07468",
            "quote_color": "#0c3642",
            "attr_color": "#0c3642"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“Beautiful relaxing space to explore your artistic endeavours. Different courses for all levels and styles offered.”</p>",
            "attribution": "- Gaby Blumberg",
            "background": "#b00e3f",
            "quote_color": "#e07468",
            "attr_color": "#e07468"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["q1", "q2", "q3", "q4", "q5"],
